WEBVTT

00:08:28.116 --> 00:08:31.836
Following the money,
we've been working, for some years,

00:08:31.876 --> 00:08:35.716
with the largest banks
and financial institutions in China.

00:08:36.116 --> 00:08:37.596
The argument we've been making

00:08:37.636 --> 00:08:41.276
is that coal is simply a bad
investment for them to make.

00:08:42.116 --> 00:08:44.836
Recently, we had
a two-day seminar in Beijing

00:08:44.876 --> 00:08:46.356
for these institutions,

00:08:46.396 --> 00:08:47.996
and it was very heartening to see

00:08:47.996 --> 00:08:50.636
that that argument
that coal is a bad investment

00:08:50.676 --> 00:08:53.756
has now been internalized
by these institutions

00:08:53.796 --> 00:08:56.036
and taken into their own thinking.

00:08:57.156 --> 00:09:00.116
When it comes to enforcement,